 "remarks": "Tucked away, set back from the road, this 5 unit complex has all the right ingredients. Open concept living room & dining space, with fireplace and hardwood floors. Deck with private setting. Tri-level townhouse with finished large lower level with washer & dryer, slider leading to the patio at grade level. Parking for 2 cars in the oversized paved lot. Easy access to all conveniences, schools, shopping, trains, restaurants, and both Merritt Parkway and I95. Springdale location has neighborhood charm & ease of casual lifestyle, near Darien border.",
